---
name: Filter Installable Errata
description: Scope the errata report.
spec:
  - question_name: Errata Filter
    question_description: >-
      JSON Query to determine which errata should be immediately
      processed
    variable: errata_filter
    type: text
    default: "[?severity==`Critical`]"
    required: true

  - question_name: Host Group
    question_description: Which host group should the report include
    type: text
    variable: host_group
    required: false

  - question_name: Host Query
    question_description: Define a custom limit instead of the built-in filtering that utilizes Host Group and Patch Group
    type: text
    variable: host_query
    required: false